# Live theme preview. Step with arrows through neighbouring dark themes so the
# preview never strobes between light and dark while a filter is half typed.
Hide
Type "cd /tmp/demo/throttle && clear && red src/window.rs"
Enter
Wait+Screen@30s /NORMAL/
Sleep 6s
Show
Sleep 800ms
Space
Type "t"
Sleep 1.4s
Up
Sleep 1.1s
Up
Sleep 1.1s
Up
Sleep 1.1s
Up
Sleep 1.1s
Up
Sleep 1.1s
Screenshot "a-themes.png"
Up
Sleep 1.1s
Up
Sleep 1.1s
Up
Sleep 1.4s
Escape
Sleep 1.6s
